msgid "execute {#execute}"
msgstr "execute {#execute}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.execute` function is not available in Qiskit v1.0. This\n"
"function served as a high-level wrapper around the\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) and\n"
"[`run`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#run) functions in Qiskit.\n"
"Instead of `qiskit.execute`, use the\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) function followed by\n"
"[`backend.run()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#run).\n"
msgstr ""
"Die Funktion `qiskit.execute` steht in Qiskit v1.0 nicht mehr zur Verfügung. Diese\n"
"Funktion diente als High-Level-Wrapper um die Funktionen\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) und\n"
"[`run`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#run) in Qiskit.\n"
"Anstelle von `qiskit.execute` verwendest du die Funktion\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) gefolgt von\n"
"[`backend.run()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#run).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the [Sampler](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Sampler)\n"
"primitive is semantically equivalent to the removed `qiskit.execute`\n"
"function. The class\n"
"[`BackendSampler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.BackendSampler) is a\n"
"generic wrapper for backends that do not support primitives:\n"
msgstr ""
"Alternativ ist das [Sampler](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Sampler)-Primitive\n"
"semantisch gleichwertig zur entfernten Funktion `qiskit.execute`.\n"
"Die Klasse\n"
"[`BackendSampler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.BackendSampler) ist ein\n"
"generischer Wrapper für Backends, die keine Primitives unterstützen:\n"

