"The `QuantumCircuit.qasm` method has been removed. Instead, use\n"
"[`qasm2.dump`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2#dump) or\n"
"[`qasm2.dumps`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2#dumps).\n"
msgstr ""
"Die Methode `QuantumCircuit.qasm` wurde entfernt. Verwende stattdessen\n"
"[`qasm2.dump`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2#dump) oder\n"
"[`qasm2.dumps`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2#dumps).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
