#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "passes {#passes}"
msgstr "passes {#passes}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `NoiseAdaptiveLayout` transpiler pass has been superseded by\n"
"[`VF2Layout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.VF2Layout) and\n"
"[`VF2PostLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.VF2PostLayout),\n"
"which set a layout based on the reported noise characteristics of a\n"
"backend. Both the pass and the corresponding `\"noise_adaptive\"` layout stage\n"
"plugin have been removed from Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Der Transpiler-Pass `NoiseAdaptiveLayout` wurde durch\n"
"[`VF2Layout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.VF2Layout) und\n"
"[`VF2PostLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.VF2PostLayout) ersetzt,\n"
"die ein Layout auf Basis der gemeldeten Rauscheigenschaften eines Backends festlegen.\n"
"Sowohl der Pass als auch das entsprechende Layout-Stage-Plugin `\"noise_adaptive\"` wurden aus Qiskit entfernt.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `CrosstalkAdaptiveSchedule` transpiler pass has been removed from the\n"
"code base. This pass was no longer usable because its internal operation\n"
"was dependent on custom properties being set in the `BackendProperties` payload\n"
"of a `BackendV1` instance. As no backends are setting these fields, the pass has\n"
"been removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Der Transpiler-Pass `CrosstalkAdaptiveSchedule` wurde aus der\n"
"Codebasis entfernt. Dieser Pass war nicht mehr verwendbar, da sein interner Betrieb\n"
"von benutzerdefinierten Eigenschaften abhing, die in der `BackendProperties`-Nutzlast\n"
"einer `BackendV1`-Instanz gesetzt wurden. Da keine Backends diese Felder setzen, wurde der Pass\n"
"entfernt.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"passmanager\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"passmanager\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "passmanager {#passmanager}"
msgstr "passmanager {#passmanager}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `append` methods of the\n"
"[`ConditionalController`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.ConditionalController),\n"
"[`FlowControllerLinear`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.FlowControllerLinear), and\n"
"[`DoWhileController`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.DoWhileController) classes\n"
"have been removed. Instead, all tasks must be provided when the controller\n"
"objects are constructed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die `append`-Methoden der Klassen\n"
"[`ConditionalController`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.ConditionalController),\n"
"[`FlowControllerLinear`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.FlowControllerLinear) und\n"
"[`DoWhileController`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.DoWhileController)\n"
"wurden entfernt. Stattdessen müssen alle Tasks beim Erstellen der Controller-Objekte übergeben werden.\n"

